  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Accelerated Tuberculosis (&quot;TB&quot;) and Non- Communicable Diseases (&quot;NCD&quot;) Screening and Case Management in Mon and Kayin States</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective is to accelerate the TB case finding in high-risk area and to improve the access to diagnosis and treatment from hard-to-reach area and conflict impact area including IDP by delivering the diagnosis and treatment one stop service nearest to the beneficiaries. In line with ongoing scale up of HIV and TB prevention, treatment and care and support activities which IOM implements in coordination with the Ministry of Health, IOM aims to conduct mobile ACF visit to high-risk population area, migrant sites.</narrative>
  </description>
